# Source: https://github.com/wellmanifest/lifecycle
# Revision: 4b5e131a670afb46ca87291479fed7c0fefcf370
# Compatibility projection; domain conformance remains authoritative.

LIFECYCLE product-release VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Product registration, release, restriction, deprecation and sunset"
STATE DRAFT INITIAL
STATE PREVIEW
STATE GENERALLY_AVAILABLE
STATE RESTRICTED
STATE DEPRECATED
STATE WITHDRAWN
STATE SUNSET TERMINAL
EVENT REGISTER
EVENT RELEASE
EVENT RESTRICT
EVENT DEPRECATE
EVENT WITHDRAW
EVENT SUNSET
EVIDENCE REGISTRATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE RELEASE_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE RESTRICTION_DECISION
EVIDENCE DEPRECATION_DECISION
EVIDENCE WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
EVIDENCE SUNSET_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION DRAFT -> PREVIEW ON REGISTER REQUIRES REGISTRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION DRAFT -> GENERALLY_AVAILABLE ON RELEASE REQUIRES RELEASE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION PREVIEW -> GENERALLY_AVAILABLE ON RELEASE REQUIRES RELEASE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION GENERALLY_AVAILABLE -> RESTRICTED ON RESTRICT REQUIRES RESTRICTION_DECISION
TRANSITION GENERALLY_AVAILABLE -> DEPRECATED ON DEPRECATE REQUIRES DEPRECATION_DECISION
TRANSITION GENERALLY_AVAILABLE -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION RESTRICTED -> DEPRECATED ON DEPRECATE REQUIRES DEPRECATION_DECISION
TRANSITION RESTRICTED -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION DEPRECATED -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION WITHDRAWN -> SUNSET ON SUNSET REQUIRES SUNSET_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION DEPRECATED -> SUNSET ON SUNSET REQUIRES SUNSET_EVIDENCE
END
